sequenceDiagram
    actor Engineer
    participant OS as OS Service Manager
    participant Agent
    participant Core
    participant Collector
    Engineer->>Agent: Install native package
    Agent->>OS: Register managed service
    Agent->>Agent: Persist installation ID / SQLite
    Engineer->>Agent: Enroll with one-time token
    Agent->>Core: Secure enrollment request
    Core-->>Agent: Binding + credential
    Agent->>Agent: Store secret securely
    Agent->>Collector: Validate/apply host baseline
    Collector-->>Agent: Runtime readiness
    Agent->>Core: Authenticated health/status
